3515 Applicants and recipients have certain responsibilities in securing support from their legally liable relatives. This chapter describes:

° who is legally liable for support;

° the assignment of rights to support;

° requirements for cooperation in support actions;

° eligibility in relation to establishing paternity;

° good cause claims as they relate to eligibility;

