R. Inaccessible Assets

Assets considered inaccessible to the assistance unit, as defined in U.P.M. 4015.15, are excluded.

S. Assets of AFDC, AABD and SSI Recipients

1. Assets owned by an assistance unit member who receives or is considered to be receiving AFDC, AABD or SSI are excluded.

2. The following individuals are considered to be receiving AFDC, AABD or SSI:

a. those whose AFDC or AABD cash benefits have been reduced to zero because of the recoupment of an overpayment;

b. those whose AFDC award has been suspended for one month because of excess income;

