P-5045.35 5. (continued)

° the gross unearned income of a person disqualified for non-compliance with Social Security number or non-citizen requirements to the extent that is pro-rated in the following manner:

- divide the total amount of the disqualified person's unearned income by the number of unit members plus the disqualified

- divide the total amount of the disqualified person's unearned income by the number of unit members plus the disqualified person;

