D. Fee Requirement

Each assistance unit is required to pay a portion of child care based on earned income and number of members in the assistance unit.

E. Penalty

The assistance unit may be penalized for part or all of the remainder of the 12 month period of eligibility as follows:

1. the assistance unit becomes ineligible for the remainder of the eligibility period when the caretaker relative terminates employment without good cause;

